{"seq":2,"slug":"event-anomaly-alert","title":"埋点异常与断崖告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/unified-event-tracking-platform/event-data-quality/event-anomaly-alert","wordCount":3174,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"埋点异常与断崖告警\">埋点异常与断崖告警</h1><p>凌晨 1 点 47 分，某个市场的加购事件量从每分钟 4.2 万条掉到 3800 条，持续了 12 分钟。值班同学在 1 点 52 分收到告警，2 点 10 分定位到一个刚发布的客户端版本在启动时崩在了 SDK 初始化路径上，2 点 30 分灰度回滚。整个事故的用户侧可见影响是 12 分钟的数据缺口——如果告警是在第二天早上报表出来时才被发现的，那这个缺口会变成 8 小时，且没有任何办法补回来。</p>\n<p>这个例子说明了断崖告警的全部价值：<strong>埋点的故障是可以用分钟级的时间精度被拦截的</strong>，前提是检测方法能够区分「正常波动」与「真实断崖」。而这两者的区分远比看起来困难——事件量有强烈的周期性、工作日与周末差两倍、大促期间量级跳变十倍、一次成功的营销活动会让曲线在十分钟内翻番。用固定阈值必然陷入两难：阈值设松了抓不到事故，设紧了每次大促都在报警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-异常检测的三个层次\">核心概念：异常检测的三个层次</h2><p>可用的检测方法按复杂度分三层，它们不是互相替代而是互补的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>检测目标</th>\n<th>响应延迟</th>\n<th>误报率</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态阈值</td>\n<td>绝对值上下限</td>\n<td>全量中断、量级跳变</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>低但只能抓极端</td>\n<td>总入口守卫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同比基线</td>\n<td>与上周同日同时段比</td>\n<td>周期性场景的偏离</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>主力量指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环比检测</td>\n<td>EWMA / 滑动分位</td>\n<td>缓慢漂移与小幅度突变</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>趋势类指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变点检测</td>\n<td>CUSUM / 贝叶斯变点</td>\n<td>持续性的水平迁移</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>低（需参数）</td>\n<td>后验确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多维下钻</td>\n<td>按端/版本/市场分群</td>\n<td>局部断崖（总量正常）</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>高（需门槛）</td>\n<td>派单定位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个必须早做的判断是<strong>用哪种方法做主力</strong>。答案取决于指标的波动特性：像「全平台事件总量」这种波动剧烈的指标，同比基线最稳；像「某端某版本某事件的完整率」这种已经归一化的比例指标，静态阈值就够用（因为比例本身的波动远小于总量）。把两者混用会导致告警体系既噪声大又漏报。</p>\n<p>下图给出从指标产生到告警派单的完整检测管线，注意「多维下钻」在总量正常时才真正发挥价值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[指标采集 1min] --&gt; B[基线计算]&#10;  B --&gt; C{同比偏离?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[写入时序库]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[二级确认: 环比/变点]&#10;  E --&gt;|确认| F[多维下钻定位]&#10;  E --&gt;|未确认| D&#10;  F --&gt; G{定位到单维?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[生成可派单告警]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[归为全局事件]&#10;  H --&gt; J[通知 + 处置预案]&#10;  D --&gt; K[看板]\">graph TD\n  A[指标采集 1min] --&gt; B[基线计算]\n  B --&gt; C{同比偏离?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[写入时序库]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[二级确认: 环比/变点]\n  E --&gt;|确认| F[多维下钻定位]\n  E --&gt;|未确认| D\n  F --&gt; G{定位到单维?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[生成可派单告警]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[归为全局事件]\n  H --&gt; J[通知 + 处置预案]\n  D --&gt; K[看板]</pre><h2 id=\"基线怎么算-周期性是核心\">基线怎么算：周期性是核心</h2><p>事件量的周期性不是噪声，而是最强的信号源。正确利用它，检测会变得简单；忽略它，检测就会沦为调参游戏。</p>\n<p>设指标在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的观测值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，同比基线取「上周同星期几、同时段」的中位数：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>median</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>21</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{x}_t = \\text{median}(x_{t-7d}, x_{t-14d}, x_{t-21d})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">median</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">14</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">21</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。用中位数而非均值，是为了让基线本身对历史异常免疫——如果上周同一时段正好也出过事故，均值会被拉低，导致本周的同类事故检测不出来。</p>\n<p>偏离程度的度量用相对偏差而不是绝对差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_t = \\frac{x_t - \\hat{x}_t}{\\max(\\hat{x}_t \\cdot \\epsilon,\\ \\sigma_{t-7d})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分母取「基线的相对容差」与「历史同期的标准差」的较大者，是为了处理两种极端：事件量小的市场（基线很小，相对波动却很大）和事件量大的场景（标准差被大促拉得极大）。只用标准差会让小市场天天报警；只用相对容差会让大促期间的正常波动被误判。</p>\n<p>对于缓慢漂移（例如某个客户端版本的用户逐渐流失导致事件量每天降 1%），同比基线检测不出来，需要环比方法。指数加权移动平均（EWMA）对缓慢变化敏感：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t = \\alpha x_t + (1-\\alpha) s_{t-1}, \\quad \\alpha \\in [0.1, 0.3]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x_t - s_{t-1}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 倍的历史残差标准差（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = 3 \\sim 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>）时触发。EWMA 的代价是对季节性不友好（它会把周期波动当成漂移），因此它应当用在已经去除周期性的指标上（例如完整率这类比例指标）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>过小的后果</th>\n<th>过大的后果</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基线回看周数</td>\n<td>用几周历史算基线</td>\n<td>基线不稳</td>\n<td>对趋势不敏感</td>\n<td>3 周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>（偏离倍数）</td>\n<td>触发阈值</td>\n<td>误报多</td>\n<td>漏报多</td>\n<td>3.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 相对容差</td>\n<td>基线最小值保护</td>\n<td>小市场疯狂报警</td>\n<td>小幅度断崖漏报</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小分母</td>\n<td>参与告警的最小样本量</td>\n<td>信号噪声大</td>\n<td>小市场无覆盖</td>\n<td>1000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续窗口</td>\n<td>连续多少个点异常才告警</td>\n<td>抖动误报</td>\n<td>响应变慢</td>\n<td>3 个点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>持续窗口</strong>是最有效的降噪手段，也最容易被省略。单点异常几乎必然是噪声（一个采集抖动、一次 GC 停顿）；连续三个点异常则大概率是真实故障。代价是响应延迟增加两个采样周期，对 1 分钟粒度的指标来说是 2 分钟——这个代价完全可以接受。</p>\n<h2 id=\"断崖的特有形态-不只是-掉下去\">断崖的特有形态：不只是「掉下去」</h2><p>事件的断崖不只表现为量下降。几种非直觉的异常形态往往对应更严重的问题，因为它们不会触发「量下降」这类直觉告警。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>真实含义</th>\n<th>检测方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>量骤降</td>\n<td>计数下降到基线的一小部分</td>\n<td>采集中断、崩溃、被限流</td>\n<td>同比基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量突增</td>\n<td>计数远高于基线</td>\n<td>重复上报、重试风暴、爬虫</td>\n<td>同比基线（上界）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量归零后恢复</td>\n<td>短暂为 0</td>\n<td>消费组位点被重置、数据被跳过</td>\n<td>归零检测 + 位点核对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段缺失率上升</td>\n<td>量正常但某字段非空率下降</td>\n<td>schema 演进 bug、解析静默失败</td>\n<td>字段级非空率监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布偏移</td>\n<td>量正常但取值分布变了</td>\n<td>用户行为变化或埋点逻辑变更</td>\n<td>分布距离（PSI）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构性偏斜</td>\n<td>某端/版本量占比突变</td>\n<td>单端 bug、灰度发布问题</td>\n<td>占比监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟升高</td>\n<td>量正常但 <code>ingest_time - event_time</code> 变大</td>\n<td>客户端积压后集中补报</td>\n<td>延迟分位监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>「量归零后恢复」是最危险的一种</strong>，因为它在总量曲线上只是一个短暂的凹陷，很容易被当成网络抖动忽略。回想 <a href=\"../event-bus-distribution/event-bus-topic\">事件总线 topic 与订阅治理</a> 中提到的判据：消费组位点滞后突然归零而非平滑下降，通常意味着位点被重置或消费者全部重启后从最新位点开始。这两种情况都会造成一段数据被永久跳过，而它不会在事件计数上留下痕迹（事件确实到了总线，只是没人消费）。因此<strong>位点异常的检测必须独立于事件量检测</strong>，它是两个不同的信号。</p>\n<p><strong>字段级非空率的监控</strong>同样必须独立建立。一个字段从 100% 非空降到 0% 可能完全不影响事件总量，但会让所有下游分析失效。这类问题的常见根因是 schema 演进中的静默失败（见 <a href=\"../event-schema-governance/event-version-evolution\">事件版本与兼容性演进</a> 中的判定矩阵）。监控方式是给每个 P0/P1 字段定义非空率基线，并按「事件名 × 端 × 版本」切分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"告警的可执行性-从信号到派单\">告警的可执行性：从信号到派单</h2><p>一个告警如果无法直接指向一个可执行的处置动作，它就是噪声。可执行性由三个要素构成：<strong>定位信息</strong>、<strong>责任人</strong>、<strong>处置预案</strong>。</p>\n<p>定位信息指告警内容必须包含已完成的初步下钻。相比「加购事件量下降 91%」，可执行的表述是「加购事件量下降 91%，且 94% 的下降来自 Android 8.3.0（占比从 32% 升至 61% 的流量版本）」。这个差别需要检测管线在触发告警前自动做一轮多维下钻（回顾上图的 F 步骤）——实现成本不高，但它把值班同学的排查时间从 30 分钟压到 3 分钟。</p>\n<p>责任人来自 <a href=\"../event-bus-distribution/event-bus-topic\">事件总线 topic 与订阅治理</a> 中的订阅登记表，也来自埋点的 owner 字段。责任人关系必须是自动解析的，不能靠「发给数据平台群让大家自己认领」。</p>\n<p>处置预案是告警体系中最常缺失的一环，也是最容易建的一环。对每一类异常，预先写好「第一步查什么、第二步做什么」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>异常类型</th>\n<th>第一步检查</th>\n<th>快速缓解</th>\n<th>长期修复</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>量骤降（单端）</td>\n<td>该版本崩溃率、SDK 初始化成功率</td>\n<td>暂停该版本灰度</td>\n<td>修复后发布补丁版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量骤降（全端）</td>\n<td>接入网关错误率、总线写入失败率</td>\n<td>启用本地缓冲</td>\n<td>扩容或修限流配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量突增</td>\n<td>重复率、批次幂等命中率</td>\n<td>接入层限流</td>\n<td>修 SDK 重复入队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段缺失率上升</td>\n<td>隔离区拒绝计数、schema 版本分布</td>\n<td>回滚 schema</td>\n<td>修类型映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费位点归零</td>\n<td>消费组实例数、位点提交记录</td>\n<td>暂停作业避免污染</td>\n<td>从湖表回放（见 <a href=\"../event-bus-distribution/event-replay-backfill\">事件回放与下游补数</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接入层背压</td>\n<td>本地缓冲水位、下游恢复时间</td>\n<td>提升 P2 采样丢弃率</td>\n<td>扩容接入层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>告警疲劳是这套体系最大的敌人。一个每天产生 200 条告警、其中 190 条是误报的体系，会在两周内让所有人把它静音——而静音之后真正的事故也不再被看到。控制手段有三个：<strong>持续窗口</strong>降噪、<strong>最小样本量门槛</strong>排除小市场、以及<strong>告警分级</strong>（P0 立即通知值班、P1 进工单当日处理、P2 只进日报）。分级比调阈值更有效，因为它不牺牲灵敏度，只牺牲响应速度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归因自动化与质量闭环\">归因自动化与质量闭环</h2><p>告警体系的成熟标志是「大多数告警在被人看到之前就已经带上了根因假设」。可行的自动化方向有两个。</p>\n<p>第一个是<strong>差异化归因</strong>：当总量异常时，自动找出「哪个维度的分布变化最能解释这次异常」。算法上是对每个维度计算该维度各取值的贡献度变化，并按贡献度排序，输出「top 3 嫌疑维度」。这是上面提到的多维下钻的自动化实现。</p>\n<p>第二个是<strong>关联分析</strong>：把埋点异常与其他运维信号（发布记录、配置变更、下游服务告警）按时间对齐，自动在告警内容里附上「过去 30 分钟内发生的相关变更」。埋点事故的根因中，发布与配置变更占绝大多数，因此这条关联能直接省掉第一轮排查。</p>\n<p>闭环的另一端是<strong>从告警反推规范</strong>。每一次真实事故都应当回答一个问题：这次的检测为什么能（或不能）在 5 分钟内发现它？如果答案是「因为没有任何指标覆盖这个环节」，那就要补一个指标；如果答案是「发现了但定位花了 40 分钟」，那就要补一次自动下钻。这个反思循环与第一章、第二章的规范修订相连——例如某类 schema 演进 bug 反复出现，说明注册中心的兼容检查或影子期不够，应当回到 <a href=\"../event-schema-governance/schema-registry-validate\">Schema 注册中心与运行时校验</a> 收紧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>异常检测分层次：<strong>静态阈值守全量入口、同比基线做主力、环比/变点检测抓漂移</strong>；方法要与指标的波动特性匹配，混用会让体系既噪声大又漏报。</li>\n<li>基线用<strong>同比中位数</strong>（3 周同星期几同时段）并对历史异常免疫；偏离度用相对偏差，分母取「相对容差」与「历史标准差」的较大者。</li>\n<li><strong>持续窗口（连续 3 点）是最有效的降噪手段</strong>；同时设最小样本量门槛排除小市场的假告警。</li>\n<li>断崖不只表现为量下降：<strong>位点归零、字段非空率下降、分布偏移、结构性偏斜</strong>都要独立监控，其中位点异常必须有独立信号。</li>\n<li>可执行告警 = <strong>定位信息 + 责任人 + 处置预案</strong>；用告警分级代替一味调阈值，避免告警疲劳导致真正的断崖被静音。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"埋点异常与断崖告警","id":"埋点异常与断崖告警"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：异常检测的三个层次","id":"核心概念-异常检测的三个层次"},{"level":2,"text":"基线怎么算：周期性是核心","id":"基线怎么算-周期性是核心"},{"level":2,"text":"断崖的特有形态：不只是「掉下去」","id":"断崖的特有形态-不只是-掉下去"},{"level":2,"text":"告警的可执行性：从信号到派单","id":"告警的可执行性-从信号到派单"},{"level":2,"text":"归因自动化与质量闭环","id":"归因自动化与质量闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"埋点完整率与丢失监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/unified-event-tracking-platform/event-data-quality/event-completeness-monitor"},"next":{"title":"事件数据合规分区","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/unified-event-tracking-platform/event-data-quality/cross-market-event-privacy"}}